{"title": "Reasoning Super Practice — Mock #30", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term in the series.</p><p>900, 1725, 3375, ?, 13275</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>900, 1725, 3375, ?, 13275</p>", "options_en": ["6350&#8195;&#8195;", "6675&#8195;&#8195;", "6400&#8195;&#8195;", "6425&#8195;&#8195;"], "options_hi": ["6350&#8195;&#8195;", "6675&#8195;&#8195;", "6400&#8195;&#8195;", "6425&#8195;&#8195;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>(900  X  2)  -  75 = 1800  -  75 = 1725</p><p>(1725  X  2)  -  75 = 3450  -  75 = 3375</p><p>(3375  X  2)  -  75 = 6750  -  75 = <b>6675</b></p><p>(6675  X  2)  -  75 = 13350  -  75 = 13275</p><p>Hence, the missing term is 6675.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(900  X  2)  -  75 = 1800  -  75 = 1725</p><p>(1725  X  2)  -  75 = 3450  -  75 = 3375</p><p>(3375  X  2)  -  75 = 6750  -  75 = <b>6675</b></p><p>(6675  X  2)  -  75 = 13350  -  75 = 13275</p><p>Hence, the missing term is 6675.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term in the series.</p><p>15625, 3125, 3140, 628, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>15625, 3125, 3140, 628, ?</p>", "options_en": ["641&#8195;&#8195;", "642&#8195;&#8195;", "643&#8195;&#8195;", "645"], "options_hi": ["641&#8195;&#8195;", "642&#8195;&#8195;", "643&#8195;&#8195;", "645"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>15625 &div; 5 = 3125</p><p>3125 + 15 = 3140</p><p>3140 &div; 5 = 628</p><p>628 + 15 = <b>643</b></p><p>Hence, the missing term is 643.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>15625 &div; 5 = 3125</p><p>3125 + 15 = 3140</p><p>3140 &div; 5 = 628</p><p>628 + 15 = <b>643</b></p><p>Hence, the missing term is 643.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the next term in the series:</p><p>5923, 6187, 6451, 6715, 6979, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2327;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p><p>5923, 6187, 6451, 6715, 6979, ?</p>", "options_en": ["7223", "7243", "7263", "7283"], "options_hi": ["7223", "7243", "7263", "7283"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Difference between successive terms is 264.</p><p>5923 + 264 = 6187,</p><p>6187 + 264 = 6451, </p><p>6451+ 264 = 6715,</p><p>6715 + 264 = 6979</p><p>6979 + 264 = <b>7243</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Difference between successive terms is 264.</p><p>5923 + 264 = 6187,</p><p>6187 + 264 = 6451, </p><p>6451+ 264 = 6715,</p><p>6715 + 264 = 6979</p><p>6979 + 264 = <b>7243</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the next term in the series: 512, 768, 1152, 1728, 2592, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2327;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;: 512, 768, 1152, 1728, 2592, ?</p>", "options_en": ["3456", "3888", "4320", "5184"], "options_hi": ["3456", "3888", "4320", "5184"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Each term is 1.5 times the previous.</p><p>512 * 1.5 =768</p><p>768 *1.5 = 1152</p><p>1152 *1.5 = 1728</p><p>2592 .5 = <b>3888.</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Each term is 1.5 times the previous.</p><p>512 * 1.5 =768</p><p>768 *1.5 = 1152</p><p>1152 *1.5 = 1728</p><p>2592 .5 = <b>3888.</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the next term in the series: &radic;1089, &radic;1225, &radic;1369, &radic;1521, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2327;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;: &radic;1089, &radic;1225, &radic;1369, &radic;1521, ?</p>", "options_en": ["&radic;1600", "&radic;1681", "&radic;1764", "&radic;1849"], "options_hi": ["&radic;1600", "&radic;1681", "&radic;1764", "&radic;1849"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Operations are 33&#178;, 35&#178;, 37&#178;, 39&#178;. </p><p>Next odd square is 41&#178;=1681, so &radic;1681.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Operations are 33&#178;, 35&#178;, 37&#178;, 39&#178;. </p><p>Next odd square is 41&#178;=1681, so &radic;1681.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the next term in the series: 832, 1329, 2161, 3490, 5651, 9141, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2327;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;: 832, 1329, 2161, 3490, 5651, 9141, ?</p>", "options_en": ["14632", "14792", "14902", "15007"], "options_hi": ["14632", "14792", "14902", "15007"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Each term equals the sum of the two preceding terms: 5651 + 9141 = 14792.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Each term equals the sum of the two preceding terms: 5651 + 9141 = 14792.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What should come in place of \"?\" in the series?</p><p>6, 15, 28, 45, ?, 91</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; \"?\" &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p>6, 15, 28, 45, ?, 91</p>", "options_en": ["62", "64", "68", "66"], "options_hi": ["62", "64", "68", "66"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Logic for the series:</p><p>6 + 9 = 15</p><p>15 + 13 = 28</p><p>28 + 17 = 45</p><p>45 + 21 = 66</p><p>66 + 25 = 91</p><p>Hence, the missing term is 66.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Logic for the series:</p><p>6 + 9 = 15</p><p>15 + 13 = 28</p><p>28 + 17 = 45</p><p>45 + 21 = 66</p><p>66 + 25 = 91</p><p>Hence, the missing term is 66.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What should come in place of \"?\" in the series?</p><p>145, 130, 118, 109, 103, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; \"?\" &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>145, 130, 118, 109, 103, ?</p>", "options_en": ["98", "100", "102", "105"], "options_hi": ["98", "100", "102", "105"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Logic for the series:</p><p>145  -  15 = 130</p><p>130  -  12 = 118</p><p>118  -  9 = 109</p><p>109  -  6 = 103</p><p>103  -  3 = 100</p><p>Hence, the missing term is 100.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Logic for the series:</p><p>145  -  15 = 130</p><p>130  -  12 = 118</p><p>118  -  9 = 109</p><p>109  -  6 = 103</p><p>103  -  3 = 100</p><p>Hence, the missing term is 100.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series.</p><p>?, 11, 27, 61, 131, 273</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>?, 11, 27, 61, 131, 273</p>", "options_en": ["3", "4", "5", "6"], "options_hi": ["3", "4", "5", "6"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Logic for the given series  - </p><p>4  X  2 + 3 = 11</p><p>11  X  2 + 5 = 27</p><p>27  X  2 + 7 = 61</p><p>61  X  2 + 9 = 131</p><p>131  X  2 + 11 = 273</p><p>Hence, missing term = 4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Logic for the given series  - </p><p>4  X  2 + 3 = 11</p><p>11  X  2 + 5 = 27</p><p>27  X  2 + 7 = 61</p><p>61  X  2 + 9 = 131</p><p>131  X  2 + 11 = 273</p><p>Hence, missing term = 4</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series.</p><p>512, 64, 192, 24, 72, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>512, 64, 192, 24, 72, ?</p>", "options_en": ["8", "9", "10", "12"], "options_hi": ["8", "9", "10", "12"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Logic for the given series  - </p><p>512 &div; 8 = 64</p><p>64  X  3 = 192</p><p>192 &div; 8 = 24</p><p>24  X  3 = 72</p><p>72 &div; 8 = 9</p><p>Hence, missing term = 9</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Logic for the given series  - </p><p>512 &div; 8 = 64</p><p>64  X  3 = 192</p><p>192 &div; 8 = 24</p><p>24  X  3 = 72</p><p>72 &div; 8 = 9</p><p>Hence, missing term = 9</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series.</p><p>64, 72, 99, 163, 288, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>64, 72, 99, 163, 288, ?</p>", "options_en": ["504", "488", "512", "492"], "options_hi": ["504", "488", "512", "492"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Here, the pattern of series is:</p><p>64 + 2<sup>3</sup> = 64 + 8 = 72.</p><p>72 + 3<sup>3</sup> = 72 + 27 = 99.</p><p>99 + 4<sup>3</sup> = 99 + 64 = 163.</p><p>163 + 5<sup>3</sup> = 163 + 125 = 288.</p><p>288 + 6<sup>3</sup> = 288 + 216 = 504.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 504.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, the pattern of series is:</p><p>64 + 2<sup>3</sup> = 64 + 8 = 72.</p><p>72 + 3<sup>3</sup> = 72 + 27 = 99.</p><p>99 + 4<sup>3</sup> = 99 + 64 = 163.</p><p>163 + 5<sup>3</sup> = 163 + 125 = 288.</p><p>288 + 6<sup>3</sup> = 288 + 216 = 504.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 504.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series.</p><p>500, 498, ?, 480, 460, 430</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>500, 498, ?, 480, 460, 430</p>", "options_en": ["494", "496", "488", "492"], "options_hi": ["494", "496", "488", "492"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p> Here, the pattern of the series is:</p><p>500 (given).</p><p>500  -  1 X 2 = 500  -  2 = 498.</p><p>498  -  2 X 3 = 498  -  6 = 492.</p><p>492  -  3 X 4 = 492  -  12 = 480.</p><p>480  -  4 X 5 = 480  -  20 = 460.</p><p>460  -  5 X 6 = 460  -  30 = 430.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 492.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p> Here, the pattern of the series is:</p><p>500 (given).</p><p>500  -  1 X 2 = 500  -  2 = 498.</p><p>498  -  2 X 3 = 498  -  6 = 492.</p><p>492  -  3 X 4 = 492  -  12 = 480.</p><p>480  -  4 X 5 = 480  -  20 = 460.</p><p>460  -  5 X 6 = 460  -  30 = 430.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 492.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series.</p><p>75, 81, 93, ?, 143, 185</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>75, 81, 93, ?, 143, 185</p>", "options_en": ["111", "113", "115", "117"], "options_hi": ["111", "113", "115", "117"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Here, the pattern of the series is:</p><p>75 (given).</p><p>75 + 2 X 3 = 75 + 6 = 81.</p><p>81 + 3 X 4 = 81 + 12 = 93.</p><p>93 + 4 X 5 = 93 + 20 = 113.</p><p>113 + 5 X 6 = 113 + 30 = 143.</p><p>143 + 6 X 7 = 143 + 42 = 185.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 113.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, the pattern of the series is:</p><p>75 (given).</p><p>75 + 2 X 3 = 75 + 6 = 81.</p><p>81 + 3 X 4 = 81 + 12 = 93.</p><p>93 + 4 X 5 = 93 + 20 = 113.</p><p>113 + 5 X 6 = 113 + 30 = 143.</p><p>143 + 6 X 7 = 143 + 42 = 185.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 113.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series.</p><p>66, 70, 79, ?, 153, 274</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>66, 70, 79, ?, 153, 274</p>", "options_en": ["100", "102", "106", "104"], "options_hi": ["100", "102", "106", "104"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Here, the pattern of the series is:.</p><p>66 (given).</p><p>66 + 2<sup>2</sup> = 66 + 4 = 70.</p><p>70 + 3<sup>2</sup> = 70 + 9 = 79.</p><p>79 + 5<sup>2</sup> = 79 + 25 = 104.</p><p>104 + 7<sup>2</sup> = 104 + 49 = 153.</p><p>153 + 11<sup>2</sup> = 153 + 121 = 274.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 104.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, the pattern of the series is:.</p><p>66 (given).</p><p>66 + 2<sup>2</sup> = 66 + 4 = 70.</p><p>70 + 3<sup>2</sup> = 70 + 9 = 79.</p><p>79 + 5<sup>2</sup> = 79 + 25 = 104.</p><p>104 + 7<sup>2</sup> = 104 + 49 = 153.</p><p>153 + 11<sup>2</sup> = 153 + 121 = 274.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 104.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series.</p><p>200, 204, ?, 233, 268, 334</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>200, 204, ?, 233, 268, 334</p>", "options_en": ["213", "215", "217", "211"], "options_hi": ["213", "215", "217", "211"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Here, the pattern of the series is:.</p><p>200 (given).</p><p>200 + 2 X 2 = 204.</p><p>204 + 3 X 3 = 213.</p><p>213 + 5 X 4 = 233.</p><p>233 + 7 X 5 = 268.</p><p>268 + 11 X 6 = 334.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 213.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, the pattern of the series is:.</p><p>200 (given).</p><p>200 + 2 X 2 = 204.</p><p>204 + 3 X 3 = 213.</p><p>213 + 5 X 4 = 233.</p><p>233 + 7 X 5 = 268.</p><p>268 + 11 X 6 = 334.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 213.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series.</p><p>100, 112, 148, 228, 378, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>100, 112, 148, 228, 378, ?</p>", "options_en": ["634", "628", "623", "630"], "options_hi": ["634", "628", "623", "630"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Here, the pattern of the series is:.</p><p>100 (given).</p><p>100 + 2<sup>2</sup> X 3 = 100 + 12 = 112.</p><p>112 + 3<sup>2</sup> X 4 = 112 + 36 = 148.</p><p>148 + 4<sup>2</sup> X 5 = 148 + 80 = 228.</p><p>228 + 5<sup>2</sup> X 6 = 228 + 150 = 378.</p><p>378 + 6<sup>2</sup> X 7 = 378 + 252 = 630.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 630.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, the pattern of the series is:.</p><p>100 (given).</p><p>100 + 2<sup>2</sup> X 3 = 100 + 12 = 112.</p><p>112 + 3<sup>2</sup> X 4 = 112 + 36 = 148.</p><p>148 + 4<sup>2</sup> X 5 = 148 + 80 = 228.</p><p>228 + 5<sup>2</sup> X 6 = 228 + 150 = 378.</p><p>378 + 6<sup>2</sup> X 7 = 378 + 252 = 630.</p><p>Thus, the missing term is 630.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term (?) in the following series:</p><p>11, 20, 36, 61, 97, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342; (?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p><p>11, 20, 36, 61, 97, ?</p>", "options_en": ["146", "144", "150", "152"], "options_hi": ["146", "144", "150", "152"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>The increments are consecutive squares: 3&#178;, 4&#178;, 5&#178;, 6&#178;, 7&#178;.</p><p>11 + 3&#178; = 11 + 9 = 20</p><p>20 + 4&#178; = 20 + 16 = 36</p><p>36 + 5&#178; = 36 + 25 = 61</p><p>61 + 6&#178; = 61 + 36 = 97</p><p>97 + 7&#178; = 97 + 49 = 146</p><p>Final Answer: 146</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The increments are consecutive squares: 3&#178;, 4&#178;, 5&#178;, 6&#178;, 7&#178;.</p><p>11 + 3&#178; = 11 + 9 = 20</p><p>20 + 4&#178; = 20 + 16 = 36</p><p>36 + 5&#178; = 36 + 25 = 61</p><p>61 + 6&#178; = 61 + 36 = 97</p><p>97 + 7&#178; = 97 + 49 = 146</p><p>Final Answer: 146</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the missing term(?) in the following series:</p><p>3, 5, 13, 43, 177, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2342;(?) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p><p>3, 5, 13, 43, 177, ?</p>", "options_en": ["885", "890", "881", "891"], "options_hi": ["885", "890", "881", "891"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>The logic of the series is:</p><p>3 * 1 + 2 = 3 + 2 = 5</p><p>5 * 2 + 3 = 10 + 3 = 13</p><p>13 * 3 + 4 = 39 + 4 = 43</p><p>43 * 4 + 5 = 172 + 5 = 177</p><p>177 * 5 + 6 = 885 + 6 = 891</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The logic of the series is:</p><p>3 * 1 + 2 = 3 + 2 = 5</p><p>5 * 2 + 3 = 10 + 3 = 13</p><p>13 * 3 + 4 = 39 + 4 = 43</p><p>43 * 4 + 5 = 172 + 5 = 177</p><p>177 * 5 + 6 = 885 + 6 = 891</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What should come in place of question mark (?) in the following number series?</p><p>7, 25, 79, 241, (?), 2185, 6559, 19681</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2361; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>7, 25, 79, 241, (?), 2185, 6559, 19681</p>", "options_en": ["724", "721", "727", "729"], "options_hi": ["724", "721", "727", "729"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>7 * 3 + 4 = 25</p><p>25 * 3 + 4 = 79</p><p>79 * 3 + 4 = 241</p><p>241 * 3 + 4 = 727 (missing term)</p><p>727 * 3 + 4 = 2185</p><p>2185 * 3 + 4 = 6559</p><p>6559 * 3 + 4 = 19681</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>7 * 3 + 4 = 25</p><p>25 * 3 + 4 = 79</p><p>79 * 3 + 4 = 241</p><p>241 * 3 + 4 = 727 (missing term)</p><p>727 * 3 + 4 = 2185</p><p>2185 * 3 + 4 = 6559</p><p>6559 * 3 + 4 = 19681</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p><p>100, 150, 300, 750, 2250, ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2371;&#2306;&#2326;&#2354;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>100, 150, 300, 750, 2250, ?</p>", "options_en": ["4500", "6750", "7875", "9000"], "options_hi": ["4500", "6750", "7875", "9000"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Here we have,</p><p>100 x 1.5 = 150</p><p>150 x 2 = 300</p><p>300 x 2.5 = 750</p><p>750 x 3 = 2250</p><p>2250 x 3.5 = 7875</p><p>So the answer is 7875</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here we have,</p><p>100 x 1.5 = 150</p><p>150 x 2 = 300</p><p>300 x 2.5 = 750</p><p>750 x 3 = 2250</p><p>2250 x 3.5 = 7875</p><p>So the answer is 7875</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}